# Includes pulled in via format.html.include-in-header. These MUST be tracked:
# a fresh CI checkout without them renders SILENTLY WITHOUT the include -- Quarto
# does not error, so CI reports success and the feature is simply missing. That
# is exactly how the version switcher shipped as a no-op on first attempt.
